From: PVE Fullcone contributors
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] netfilter: scope fullcone to native IPv4 MASQUERADE

Keep the SONiC conntrack-backed translated-source index and the 987 locks.
Add private eligibility, random-independent reuse, and final-null-binding
inbound lookup. Explicit NAT rules and local sockets take precedence.

